@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #365879
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4F8
title U06a 时序图：通知命令持久化、生效与分发
autonumber
actor 操作者 as User
boundary "浏览器" as UI
control "FastAPI / Facade" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
control "CommandProcessor" as Processor
entity "World / State" as World
control "OutboxDispatcher" as Dispatcher
queue "Redis Streams" as Redis
User -> UI : 发布全体活动通知
UI -> API : POST command(request_id)
API -> PG : 插入CommandEnvelope（唯一request_id）
PG --> API : 提交成功 / 已有回执
API --> UI : 202 + command_id（已接收）
... Runtime异步轮询 ...
group 同一个短数据库事务
  Processor -> PG : 锁run行，取可执行命令并加载World
  PG --> Processor : 命令与最新世界状态
  Processor -> Processor : CommandCodec.decode()
  Processor -> World : state.classify(PUBLISH_NOTICE)
  World --> Processor : EXECUTE
  Processor -> World : PublishNoticeCommand.execute(world)
  World --> Processor : 更新的World + NoticePublished
  Processor -> PG : 保存状态、events、outbox、命令结果
  PG --> Processor : COMMIT（通知已生效）
end
... Dispatcher独立轮询 ...
Dispatcher -> PG : 读取待发布Outbox
PG --> Dispatcher : 事件42
Dispatcher ->> Redis : XADD NoticePublished(event_id, seq=42)
Redis --> Dispatcher : 发布确认
Dispatcher -> PG : 标记Outbox已发布
note over Dispatcher,Redis
发送成功但标记失败可重复发送。
消费者按事件ID去重。
两个消费组分别获得事件，后续见U06b。
end note
@enduml
